ounds%20array%20behavior%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27For%20the%20retained%20conflicting%20array%20and%20string%20inputs%2C%20use%20the%20newer%20JavaScript%20behavior%20in%20both%20runtime%20packages%3A%20actual%20UTF-16%20code%20unit%20string%20lengths%20and%20observable%20out%20of%20bounds%20array%20reads%20remain%20part%20of%20the%20selected%20semantics.%20Preserve%20every%20original%20source%20input%2C%20including%20the%20complete%20ARRAYS%20corpus%20and%20the%20original%20string%20length%20source%2C%20and%20add%20genuine%20cross-runtime%20controls%20for%20supplementary%20Unicode%20and%20out%20of%20bounds%20reads%20rather%20than%20preserving%20obsolete%20contradictory%20native%20expectations.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27originalArrayAndStringInputsRetained%27%2C%20%27utf16StringLengthParityExecuted%27%2C%20%27observableOutOfBoundsParityExecuted%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-PARITY-OBSOLETE-NATIVE-EXPECTATIONS%27%2C%20%27evidence%20based%20correction%20of%20obsolete%20native%20array%20expectations%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Correct%20the%20obsolete%20Rust%20expectations%20identified%20in%20the%20captured%20question%20and%20answer%20to%20the%20newer%20JavaScript%20behavior%20while%20retaining%20all%20original%20test%20inputs%20and%20intended%20coverage.%20Record%20the%20actual%20contradictory%20before%20and%20after%20expectations%20and%20the%20active%20language%20or%20dependency%20context%3B%20genuine%20unsupported%20mutations%20and%20unrelated%20refusal%20boundaries%20remain%20required.%20Updating%20a%20wrong%20expectation%20is%20not%20permission%20to%20drop%20a%20fixture%2C%20hide%20a%20failed%20observation%20or%20claim%20unexecuted%20native%20parity.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27obsoleteExpectationConflictRecorded%27%2C%20%27correctedExpectationsFollowModernJavaScript%27%2C%20%27originalCoverageAndGenuineRefusalsRetained%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27compactContributorInstructionsRequest%27%2C%20compactContributorInstructionsSource%2C%20%27critical-conversation-requirements%27%2C%20%27contributor-instructions%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-CONTRIBUTOR-INSTRUCTIONS-CONCISE%27%2C%20%27minimal%20contributor%20instruction%20wording%20with%20unchanged%20obligations%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Reduce%20AGENTS.md%20and%20CLAUDE.md%20to%20the%20minimum%20practical%20wording%20while%20retaining%20the%20same%20substantive%20contributor%20obligations%20and%20the%20authoritative%20vision%20reference.%20Shared%20instructions%20may%20be%20referenced%20to%20avoid%20duplication%3B%20brevity%20does%20not%20remove%20implementation%2C%20evidence%2C%20resource%2C%20JavaScript-first%2C%20native%20CI%20or%20review%20obligations.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27contributorInstructionsReducedWithoutLostObligations%27%2C%20%27sharedInstructionsRemainAuthoritative%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-ASSERTION-EVIDENCE-BASED-CORRECTION%27%2C%20%27demonstrably%20wrong%20assertions%20remain%20correctable%20without%20losing%20coverage%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Allow%20demonstrably%20wrong%20assertions%20and%20obsolete%20expected%20values%20to%20be%20corrected%20using%20recorded%20source%2C%20language%20or%20dependency%20evidence%20while%20preserving%20the%20original%20test%20inputs%2C%20genuine%20requirements%2C%20intended%20coverage%20and%20honest%20failure%20reporting.%20Record%20the%20reason%20and%20replacement%20expectation%2C%20update%20affected%20tests%20consistently%20and%20execute%20the%20corrected%20applicable%20assertions%3B%20a%20correction%20cannot%20excuse%20a%20real%20defect%2C%20weaken%20an%20acceptance%20obligation%20or%20stand%20in%20for%20execution%20evidence.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27wrongAssertionCorrectionSupportedByEvidence%27%2C%20%27originalInputsAndCoverageRetained%27%2C%20%27correctedApplicableAssertionsExecuted%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%2C%20true%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27versionBoundedAssertionsRequest%27%2C%20versionBoundedAssertionsSource%2C%20%27critical-conversation-requirements%27%2C%20%27assertion-version-ranges%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-ASSERTION-EXPLICIT-VERSION-RANGES%27%2C%20%27explicit%20applicable%20version%20ranges%20for%20version%20dependent%20assertions%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Every%20assertion%20whose%20expected%20behavior%20depends%20on%20a%20language%20or%20dependency%20version%20declares%20its%20version%20subject%2C%20explicit%20minimum%20and%20maximum%20bounds%2C%20endpoint%20inclusion%20and%20evidence%20for%20the%20expectation.%20Select%20and%20execute%20the%20expectation%20applicable%20to%20the%20actual%20active%20version%20instead%20of%20treating%20one%20historical%20result%20as%20valid%20for%20all%20versions%3B%20retain%20the%20original%20inputs%20and%20the%20recorded%20historical%20expectation.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27versionDependentExpectationsHaveExplicitBounds%27%2C%20%27activeVersionSelectsApplicableExpectation%27%2C%20%27historicalInputsAndExpectationsRetained%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-ASSERTION-VERSION-COVERAGE%27%2C%20%27missing%20and%20conflicting%20active%20version%20expectation%20coverage%20refuses%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Require%20exactly%20one%20applicable%20expectation%20for%20an%20active%20version%20and%20validate%20every%20declared%20range%2C%20including%20inactive%20alternatives.%20Missing%20coverage%2C%20overlapping%20or%20conflicting%20ranges%2C%20malformed%20versions%20and%20ambiguous%20expectation%20identities%20fail%20explicitly%20rather%20than%20skipping%20the%20assertion%20or%20choosing%20an%20arbitrary%20alternative.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27missingActiveVersionCoverageRefused%27%2C%20%27overlappingAndConflictingRangesRefused%27%2C%20%27allDeclaredRangesValidated%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-ASSERTION-LANGUAGE-EDITION-ORDER%27%2C%20%27declared%20language%20edition%20order%20distinct%20from%20release%20coordinates%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Compare%20dependency%20release%20coordinates%20with%20their%20explicit%20precision%2C%20and%20compare%20language%20editions%20using%20their%20declared%20order%20rather%20than%20assuming%20edition%20names%20obey%20semantic%20version%20ordering.%20Unknown%20active%20editions%20and%20invalid%20release%20coordinates%20refuse%20before%20expectation%20selection.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27releasePrecisionExplicit%27%2C%20%27languageEditionOrderExplicit%27%2C%20%27unknownEditionsAndInvalidCoordinatesRefused%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%2C%20true%29%2C%0A%5D%29%3B%0A%0Aexport%20const%20CRITICAL_CONVERSATION_REQUIREMENTS%20%3D%20Object.freeze%28%5B%0A%20%20...rows%28%27ciCancellationInvestigationRequest%27%2C%20ciCancellationInvestigationSource%2C%20%27critical-conversation-requirements%27%2C%20%27workflow-contract%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-WORKFLOW-CANCELLED-CI-INVESTIGATION%27%2C%20%27evidence-based%20investigation%20of%20the%20reported%20CI%20run%20cancellation%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27The%20reported%20cancellation%20of%20CI%20run%2038431880453%20is%20investigated%20using%20actual%20workflow%2C%20job%20or%20check-run%20evidence%20and%20the%20relevant%20workflow%20configuration.%20Its%20cause%20and%20supporting%20evidence%20are%20recorded%20rather%20than%20assuming%20the%20user%20cancelled%20it.%20The%20investigation%20preserves%20the%20existing%20CI%20follow-through%20and%20repair%20requirements.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27cancelledWorkflowInvestigated%27%2C%20%27cancellationCauseSupportedByActualWorkflowEvidence%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%2C%20true%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27localResourceScopeRequest%27%2C%20localResourceScopeSource%2C%20%27critical-conversation-requirements%27%2C%20%27workflow-contract%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-LOCAL-RESOURCE-PROJECT-OWNED-CLEANUP%27%2C%20%27cleanup%20limited%20to%20disk%20space%20owned%20by%20this%20meta-language%20task%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Cleanup%20performed%20for%20this%20task%20removes%20only%20disk%20space%20demonstrably%20owned%20by%20meta-language%20work.%20Unrelated%20user%20files%2C%20other%20projects%20and%20system%20data%20remain%20untouched%3B%20recovering%20disk%20space%20does%20not%20authorize%20broader%20deletion.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27metaLanguageOwnershipEstablishedBeforeCleanup%27%2C%20%27unrelatedDiskSpacePreserved%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-LOCAL-RESOURCE-CAREFUL-BOUNDED-USE%27%2C%20%27careful%20local%20resource%20use%20within%20available%20capacity%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Contributors%20check%20available%20system%20resources%20and%20keep%20local%20disk%2C%20memory%20and%20process%20use%20bounded%20while%20performing%20this%20task%2C%20preventing%20meta-language%20work%20from%20exhausting%20the%20host%20resources.%20Resource%20care%20does%20not%20remove%20inherited%20project%20requirements%20or%20replace%20required%20CI%20verification.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27localResourceUseChecked%27%2C%20%27localWorkBoundedToAvailableResources%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-LOCAL-RESOURCE-RUST-COMPILATION-CI-ONLY%27%2C%20%27Rust%20compilation%20exclusively%20in%20CI%2FCD%20for%20this%20task%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27No%20contributor%20compiles%20Rust%20locally%20for%20any%20purpose%20during%20this%20task.%20Rust%20compilation%20and%20compiled%20validation%20run%20only%20in%20CI%2FCD%3B%20local%20authoring%20and%20bounded%20JavaScript%20checks%20preserve%20all%20required%20native%20verification%20obligations.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27noLocalRustCompilation%27%2C%20%27rustCompilationRunsOnlyInCi%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%2C%20true%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27agentReductionRequest%27%2C%20agentReductionSource%2C%20%27critical-conversation-requirements%27%2C%20%27workflow-contract%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-WORKFLOW-GRADUAL-AGENT-REDUCTION%27%2C%20%27gradual%20conclusion%20of%20agent%20work%20followed%20by%20coordinator-only%20implementation%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27After%20the%20later%20user%20steering%2C%20active%20contributors%20finish%20their%20existing%20scoped%20work%20and%20agent%20activity%20gradually%20concludes.%20Once%20all%20active%20contributors%20finish%2C%20the%20coordinator%20continues%20implementation%20and%20CI%20follow-up%20alone.%20The%20earlier%20parallel%20drafting%20phase%20remains%20recorded%2C%20and%20no%20inherited%20project%20scope%20is%20removed.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27existingAgentWorkConcludesGradually%27%2C%20%27coordinatorWorksAloneAfterAgentCompletion%27%2C%20%27inheritedProjectScopeRetained%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%2C%20true%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27associativeDataStorageRequest%27%2C%20associativeDataSource%2C%20%27associative-data-storage%27%2C%20%27associative-data-storage%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-ASSOCIATIVE-DATA-STORAGE%27%2C%20%27project-owned%20structured%20data%20stored%20through%20the%20associative%20Links%20stack%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Project-owned%20structured%20records%2C%20including%20native%20grammar%20corpus%20fixtures%20such%20as%20the%20Agda%20corpus%2C%20use%20inspectable%20Links%20Notation%20through%20the%20relevant%20associative%20stack%20by%20default.%20Generated%20native%20grammars%2C%20fixture%20records%20and%20shared%20package%20data%20remain%20reconstructable%20and%20usable%20through%20the%20existing%20public%20algorithms%20without%20hidden%20authoritative%20JSON%20side%20tables.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27projectStructuredDataUsesLinksNotation%27%2C%20%27nativeGrammarCorpusStoredAsLinkedRecords%27%2C%20%27associativeStackDataAlgorithmsReused%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-ASSOCIATIVE-DATA-AUTOMATED-CONVERSION%27%2C%20%27automated%20lossless%20conversion%20of%20structured%20data%20and%20fixture%20metadata%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Structured-data%20migration%20is%20automated%20rather%20than%20manually%20rewriting%20records.%20The%20converter%20losslessly%20reconstructs%20the%20original%20values%20and%20preserves%20identities%2C%20source%20order%2C%20exact%20numbers%2C%20strings%2C%20aliases%2C%20required%20fixtures%2C%20acceptance%20assertions%20and%20cross-record%20references.%20Both%20package%20readers%20and%20repository%20tooling%20retain%20their%20observable%20behavior%2C%20and%20conversion%20does%20not%20reduce%20protected%20requirement%20scope.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27structuredDataConversionAutomated%27%2C%20%27convertedValuesLosslesslyReconstructed%27%2C%20%27identitiesOrderNumbersStringsAliasesAndReferencesPreserved%27%2C%20%27fixtureIdsAndAcceptanceAssertionsPreserved%27%2C%20%27packageReadersAndToolingBehaviorPreserved%27%2C%20%27protectedScopeNotReduced%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-ASSOCIATIVE-DATA-JSON-EXCEPTIONS%27%2C%20%27JSON%20retained%20only%20for%20necessary%20declared%20external%20interfaces%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27JSON%20remains%20only%20where%20a%20genuine%20external%20standard%20or%20source-language%20JSON%20interface%20requires%20it%2C%20with%20an%20explicit%20recorded%20necessity%20and%20boundary.%20Convenience%2C%20an%20existing%20JSON%20file%20or%20an%20opaque%20payload%20does%20not%20establish%20an%20exception%3B%20the%20project-owned%20authoritative%20representation%20remains%20linked%20data%20wherever%20the%20interface%20permits%20it.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27jsonExceptionsHaveExplicitNecessity%27%2C%20%27externalJsonInterfaceBoundariesRecorded%27%2C%20%27noConvenienceOrOpaquePayloadException%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%2C%20true%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27externalGrammarStorageRequest%27%2C%20externalGrammarSource%2C%20%27temporary-external-grammar-inputs%27%2C%20%27external-grammar-storage%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-EXTERNAL-GRAMMAR-UNTRACKED%27%2C%20%27upstream%20external%20grammar%20and%20parser%20assets%20excluded%20from%20version%20control%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Upstream%20external%20raw%20grammars%2C%20parser%20sources%2C%20compiled%20parsers%20and%20WebAssembly%20assets%20are%20not%20tracked%20in%20the%20repository.%20The%20project-generated%20native%20or%20meta-language%20Links%20Notation%20grammars%20and%20prepared%20snapshots%20remain%20permitted%20and%20preserve%20all%20inherited%20grammar%2C%20provenance%20and%20offline%20production%20requirements.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27externalUpstreamAssetsUntracked%27%2C%20%27generatedNativeSnapshotsRetained%27%2C%20%27inheritedOfflineAndProvenanceRequirementsPreserved%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-EXTERNAL-GRAMMAR-TEMPORARY-DOWNLOAD%27%2C%20%27temporary%20pinned%20external%20grammar%20inputs%20with%20checked%20provenance%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27A%20reproducible%20tool%20downloads%20upstream%20external%20grammar%20and%20oracle%20assets%20temporarily%20when%20import%2C%20regeneration%20or%20independent%20tests%20require%20them%2C%20verifies%20their%20pinned%20checksums%20and%20records%20revision%2C%20origin%20and%20license%20provenance.%20Downloaded%20inputs%20remain%20outside%20tracked%20files%2C%20temporary%20assets%20are%20cleaned%20after%20use%2C%20and%20generated%20native%20snapshots%20remain%20independently%20usable%20without%20those%20assets.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27temporaryDownloaderExecuted%27%2C%20%27pinnedChecksumsVerified%27%2C%20%27downloadProvenanceRetained%27%2C%20%27downloadedAssetsUntracked%27%2C%20%27temporaryAssetsCleaned%27%2C%20%27generatedSnapshotsUsableWithoutDownloads%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%2C%20true%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27externalGrammarIgnoreRequest%27%2C%20externalGrammarIgnoreSource%2C%20%27temporary-external-grammar-inputs%27%2C%20%27external-grammar-storage%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-EXTERNAL-GRAMMAR-IGNORED-DIRECTORY%27%2C%20%27external%20grammar%20download%20folders%20explicitly%20ignored%20by%20Git%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Every%20folder%20used%20for%20external%20grammar%2C%20parser%20or%20oracle%20downloads%20is%20explicitly%20covered%20by%20Git%20ignore%20rules%2C%20so%20ordinary%20staging%20cannot%20add%20downloaded%20inputs.%20Ignore%20rules%20preserve%20the%20project-generated%20native%20Links%20Notation%20grammars%2C%20source%20manifests%2C%20checksums%20and%20provenance%20records%20that%20must%20remain%20tracked.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27externalGrammarDirectoriesIgnored%27%2C%20%27ordinaryStagingExcludesDownloads%27%2C%20%27generatedSnapshotsAndProvenanceRemainTracked%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%2C%20true%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27grammarInferenceIssue%27%2C%20inferenceSource%2C%20%27dynamic-knowledge-and-language-extension%27%2C%20%27grammar-inference%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-EXISTING-WORK-AUDIT%27%2C%20%27existing%20inference%20foundations%20and%20JavaScript%20parity%20gaps%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Audit%20and%20reuse%20the%20lexical%2C%20state-merging%2C%20context-free%2C%20structural-prior%2C%20active-learning%20and%20minimization%20work%20associated%20with%20issues93%2C114%2C117%20through123%20and%20the%20existing%20Rust%20inference%20modules.%20Closed%20issues%20do%20not%20prove%20complete%20capability%20or%20remove%20JavaScript%20parity%20obligations.%27%2C%20%5B%27existingInferenceModulesAudited%27%2C%20%27closedIssueEvidenceRechecked%27%2C%20%27javascriptParityGapsRecorded%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-RESEARCH-SELECTION%27%2C%20%27pinned%20modern%20grammar%20discovery%20research%20and%20selection%20rationale%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Compare%20the%20pinned%20XVada%2C%20Crucio%2C%20NatGI%20and%20attributed%20grammar-inference%20methods%20with%20recorded%20revisions%2C%20implementations%2C%20licenses%2C%20independent%20oracles%2C%20datasets%20and%20configurations.%20Paper-reported%20results%20remain%20hypotheses%20for%20local%20reproduction%2C%20and%20method%20selection%20retains%20its%20evidence%20rationale.%27%2C%20%5B%27researchRevisionsAndLicensesPinned%27%2C%20%27fourResearchMethodsEvaluated%27%2C%20%27selectionRationaleAndReproductionRecorded%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-INDEPENDENT-EVALUATION%27%2C%20%27independent%20held-out%20grammar%20discovery%20evaluation%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Separate%20discovery%20training%20from%20holdout%20evaluation%20and%20test%20adversarial%20rejections%20and%20real%20projects%20under%20several%20independent%20oracles.%20Record%20precision%2C%20recall%2C%20F1%2C%20CST%20fields%2C%20trivia%2C%20spans%2C%20attributed%20behavior%2C%20reconstruction%2C%20grammar%20size%2C%20determinism%2C%20query%20counts%2C%20elapsed%20time%20and%20peak%20memory.%27%2C%20%5B%27trainingAndHoldoutSeparated%27%2C%20%27multipleIndependentOraclesAndProjectsUsed%27%2C%20%27allRequiredQualityAndResourceMetricsRecorded%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-COMPARATIVE-BENCHMARKS%27%2C%20%27reproducible%20inference%20comparison%20within%20common%20budgets%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Benchmark%20existing%20inference%20and%20selected%20modern%20methods%20with%20the%20same%20pinned%20workloads%20and%20budgets.%20Retain%20all%20failures%20and%20disagreement%20traces%2C%20select%20reproducible%20improvements%20without%20weakening%20acceptance%2C%20and%20keep%20statistical%20coverage%20distinct%20from%20semantic%20proof.%27%2C%20%5B%27commonBudgetsAndWorkloadsUsed%27%2C%20%27failuresAndDisagreementsRetained%27%2C%20%27reproducibleImprovementMeasured%27%2C%20%27statisticsNotPresentedAsProof%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-CI-RESOURCE-POLICY%27%2C%20%27bounded%20JavaScript-first%20inference%20development%20and%20CI%20artifacts%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Use%20targeted%20JavaScript%20authoring%20locally%3B%20run%20Rust%20compilation%2C%20broad%20discovery%20experiments%2C%20whole%20corpora%20and%20downstream%20workloads%20in%20CI%20with%20bounded%20caches%20and%20per-run%20artifacts.%20Record%20critical%20scope%2C%20API%20parity%20and%20exact%20executed%20observations%20without%20completion%20claims%20for%20missing%20behavior.%27%2C%20%5B%27javascriptFirstInferenceDevelopment%27%2C%20%27expensiveInferenceAndRustRunInCI%27%2C%20%27boundedCachesAndRunArtifacts%27%2C%20%27exactEvidenceAndApiParityRecorded%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%2C%20true%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27grammarInferenceIssue%27%2C%20inferenceSource%2C%20%27dynamic-knowledge-and-language-extension%27%2C%20%27grammar-inference%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-PUBLIC-API-CLI%27%2C%20%27matching%20public%20grammar%20discovery%20library%20and%20CLI%20interfaces%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27JavaScript%20and%20Rust%20library%20and%20CLI%20interfaces%20accept%20pinned%20positive%20and%20negative%20examples%2C%20independent%20membership%20or%20parser%20oracles%2C%20optional%20execution%20traces%20and%20existing%20grammars.%20Diagnostics%20identify%20unresolved%20context%20sensitivity%2C%20scanners%20and%20action%20semantics%20rather%20than%20silently%20approximating%20them.%27%2C%20%5B%27matchingDiscoveryApiAndCliExecuted%27%2C%20%27examplesOraclesTracesAndSourcesAccepted%27%2C%20%27unsupportedSemanticsPreciselyDiagnosed%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-NATIVE-OUTPUT%27%2C%20%27fully%20native%20executable%20discovered%20grammars%20and%20attributed%20behavior%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Discovery%20emits%20executable%20Links%20grammars%20with%20lossless%20CST%20structure%2C%20lexer%20and%20scanner%20state%2C%20precedence%2C%20ambiguity%2C%20recovery%20and%20attributed%20semantic%20actions.%20Foreign%20parser%20blobs%2C%20opaque%20sources%20and%20host%20callbacks%20cannot%20stand%20in%20for%20native%20operational%20definitions.%27%2C%20%5B%27discoveredGrammarNativeAndExecutable%27%2C%20%27discoveredCstAndScannerSemanticsPreserved%27%2C%20%27attributedActionsAndRecoveryExplicit%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-GENERIC-UNION%27%2C%20%27generic%20structural%20and%20semantic%20discovery%20through%20the%20source-union%20pipeline%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Discover%20lexical%20classes%2C%20recursion%20and%20semantic%20relations%20generically%2C%20preserving%20every%20source%20production%20and%20provenance.%20Merge%20discovered%20definitions%20with%20the%20applicable%20official%20and%20matu